5. Use JDBC batch processing if connecting to Database: If your 'Student' object is retrieving data from a database, it would be helpful to use batch processing instead of processing one at a time.

6. Minimize scope of variables: Always try to reduce the scope of variables as much as possible. This helps improve readability and maintainability of the code.

