處理大數據集時，我們通常會使用Hadoop MapReduce框架。以下是一個基礎的Java代碼示例，該代碼將使用Hadoop實現一個簡單的單詞計數任務，從而聚合數據。

首先，我們需要定義我們的Map函數，該函數負責讀取輸入的數據，然後生成一組對應的(key, value)對：

```java
import java.io.IOException;
import org.apache.hadoop.io.LongWritable;
import org.apache.hadoop.io.Text;
import org.apache.hadoop.mapreduce.Mapper;

public class WordCountMapper extends
        Mapper<LongWritable, Text, Text, LongWritable> {
    private final static LongWritable ONE = new LongWritable(1);
    private Text word = new Text();

    public void map(LongWritable key, Text value, Context context)
            throws IOException, InterruptedException {
        String line = value.toString();
        for (String token : line.split("\\s+")) {
            word.set(token);
            context.write(word, ONE);
        }
    }
}
```

接下來，我們需要定義我們的Reduce函數，該函數負責縮減我們的(key, value)對，將它們分組並生成聚合的結果：

```java
import java.io.IOException;
import org.apache.hadoop.io.LongWritable;
import org.apache.hadoop.io.Text;
import org.apache.hadoop.mapreduce.Reducer;

public class WordCountReducer extends
        Reducer<Text, LongWritable, Text, LongWritable> {
    private LongWritable result = new LongWritable();

    public void reduce(Text key, Iterable<LongWritable> values, Context context)
            throws IOException, InterruptedException {
        long sum = 0;
        for (LongWritable val : values) {
            sum += val.get();
        }
        result.set(sum);
        context.write(key, result);
    }
}
```

最後，我們需要定義我們的主函數，該函數負責配置我們的作業並運行它：

```java
import org.apache.hadoop.conf.Configuration;
import org.apache.hadoop.fs.Path;
import org.apache.hadoop.io.LongWritable;
import org.apache.hadoop.io.Text;
import org.apache.hadoop.mapreduce.Job;
import org.apache.hadoop.mapreduce.lib.input.FileInputFormat;
import org.apache.hadoop.mapreduce.lib.output.FileOutputFormat;

public class WordCount {

    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        Configuration conf = new Configuration();
        Job job = Job.getInstance(conf, "word count");
        job.setJarByClass(WordCount.class);
        job.setMapperClass(WordCountMapper.class);
        job.setCombinerClass(WordCountReducer.class);
        job.setReducerClass(WordCountReducer.class);
        job.setOutputKeyClass(Text.class);
        job.setOutputValueClass(LongWritable.class);
        FileInputFormat.addInputPath(job, new Path(args[0]));
        FileOutputFormat.setOutputPath(job, new Path(args[1]));
        System.exit(job.waitForCompletion(true) ? 0 : 1);
    }
}
```
這個代碼示例是如何讀取大數據集，聚合數據（通過計算每個單詞的出現次數），並將結果存回磁碟的基本範例。 使用Hadoop MapReduce，我們可以有效地處理適合在一個節點上處理的大型數據集。

Here is an implementation using OpenMP to parallelize the computation in C:

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <math.h>
#include <time.h>
#include <omp.h>

#define MAX_ITER 1000
#define TOLERANCE 0.001
#define ALPHA 0.3

// Gradient function
double grad(int i, double w) {
    return i % 2 == 0 ? -12 * pow(w, 3) + 10 * w + 5 : 14 * pow(w, 2) + 8 * w - 7;
}

// Gradient descent routine
void optimize(int n, double* w) {
    int iter = 0;
    double delta;
    do {
        delta = 0.0;
        // Compute gradient and update
        #pragma omp parallel for reduction(+:delta)
        for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {
            const double dw = ALPHA * grad(i + 1, w[i]);
		double new_w = w[i] - dw;
            delta += fabs(new_w - w[i]);
            w[i] = new_w;
        }
        iter++;
    } while (delta > TOLERANCE && iter < MAX_ITER);
}

int main() {
   srand(time(NULL));  
   int n = 10;  // let's assume we have 10 parameters
   // Allocate and initialize w with random numbers
   double* w = malloc(n * sizeof(double));
   for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
       w[i] = ((double) rand() / (RAND_MAX)); // parameter initialization by random number
   }

   // Run optimization
   optimize(n, w);

   // Print optimized parameters
   for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
      printf("Parameter w_%d : %f\n", i+1, w[i]);
   }

   free(w);
   return 0;
}
```

This code first randomly initializes the parameters using the srand and rand functions. It then calls the optimize function to perform the actual gradient descent. Note that in this implementation, the termination criteria for the gradient is the sum of the absolute changes in the `w` values across all iterations (the `delta` variable), which simplifies comparing it to a single tolerance value.

If you want to use only `C` Standard Library and not OpenMP, you will not be able to parallelize the computation as easily. You would need to manually spawn multiple threads using the POSIX pthread library, and ensure correct synchronization and reduce operations, which would significantly complicate the code.

