Here's a simple JavaScript solution which will allow you to isolate integers and characters from an array and string respectively.

```javascript
// Configure thresholds
const numThreshold = 10;
const charThreshold = 10;  // Assuming the ASCII threshold to be 10, which is a non-printable character in ASCII table. 

