The array size in your function is not correctly determined. In C++, if you want to determine the size of an array, you need to pass it as an argument to your function because the `sizeof` operator does not work as you expect it to when dealing with array arguments (actually the 'array' that you're passing is merely a pointer in the context of the function). Here is the correct code:

