Here is the PHP function that fulfills these requirements:

```php
function is_email_from_domain($email, $domain) {
    // Validate the email according to RFC 5322
    if (!filter_var($email, FILTER_VALIDATE_EMAIL)) {
        return false;
    }

    // Retrieve the domain of the email
    $emailDomain = array_pop(explode('@', $email));

    // Verify if the email domain matches the specified domain
    if ($emailDomain === $domain) {
        return true;
    }

    // Handle cases where the email contains subdomains
    $subdomainPattern = '/^([a-zA-Z0-9]+\.)+' . preg_quote($domain, '/') . '$/';

    if (preg_match($subdomainPattern, $emailDomain)) {
        return true;
    }

    return false;
}
```

