In this code, we first create and print an unsorted array of strings. Then, we call Arrays.sort on the array to sort it, and print the array out again to see the result.

Keep in mind that this sorting is case-sensitive. To implement case-insensitive sorting, you would use Arrays.sort(myArray, String.CASE_INSENSITIVE_ORDER); 

